- "make it a cute ribbon instead"
- "actually for the camera, can you make it look like a digital camera, so my photo would be on the camera screen"

**Flowers** — generated by Figma AI, used on the homepage of the Flowers stylesheet.
Prompts:
- "can you add a lily and orchid vibe to the background?"
- "can you generate a flower frame with vines that i can put my headshot on the flower page"

